# Uploads are public (document previews/downloads). During development the app
# runs on the Vite origin and fetch()es Word documents from here to render the
# Documents preview -- the browser blocks that cross-origin read unless the file
# response allows it. Match cors_origin in config.php. Not needed in production,
# where the app and uploads share one origin.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header set Access-Control-Allow-Origin "http://localhost:5173"
</IfModule>
